.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_SECTION_GET 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_section_get
.Nd return a section handle by stable index
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_section_t *
.Fn elf_section_get "const elfobj_t *obj" "size_t index"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_section_get
function returns the section handle at
.Fa index
from
.Fa obj .
.Pp
This accessor is intended for deterministic section-table iteration by tooling
such as
.Xr size 1 ,
.Xr objdump 1 ,
and
.Xr readelf 1 .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the section handle when
.Fa index
is valid.
Returns NULL for out-of-range indices or NULL
.Fa obj .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_section 3 ,
.Xr elf_section_addr 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
